Subject: Cantor Integrated Faculty Process

Description: Signed constitutional profile that builds all seven compiled faculties into Cantor's proof-bearing semantic cycle while retaining SAIL primitives, bounded activation, Observer governance, and the existing SemanticTransition waist.

@ [source_document] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-08-03_cantor_integrated_faculty_process\Dictated_Cantor_Integrated_Faculty_Process_Source.sop
